Body:
Could you try disabling TUI attention sounds as a temporary workaround while we fix the underlying audio initialization issue? In `tui.json` (or `tui.jsonc`), set:

```jsonc
{
  "attention": {
    "sound": false
  }
}
```

Then restart the TUI and let us know whether the ALSA messages stop. If needed, disabling attention entirely with `"enabled": false` should also prevent this path.
